---
---

<section id="planos" class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Cabeçalho -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="badge-subtle mb-4">Transparência Absoluta</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mt-3">
        Acesso Completo. Sem Contratos Abusivos.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Chega de comprometer R$ 2.500 no limite do cartão em cursos impessoais. No Fluente no Mundo você tem um plano acessível, transparente e com liberdade total.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards de Planos -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Plano Mensal (Acesso Flexível) -->
      <div class="editorial-card p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
              Assinatura Flexível
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Cancele quando quiser</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900">
            Plano Mensal
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 mb-6">
            Ideal para quem busca flexibilidade máxima e deseja testar o método mês a mês.
          </p>

          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">R$</span>
            <span class="text-5xl font-heading font-black text-slate-900">39</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-600">,90</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">/mês</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Benefícios Inclusos -->
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Acesso a todas as <strong>Formações Essenciais</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Aulas ao Vivo semanais</strong> às quartas-feiras</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Canal <strong>SOS Professora</strong> em até 48h</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Vocabulário & Sistema SRS (3 etapas)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Vivência Global (Séries, Filmes e Músicas)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Certificados Modulares a cada 3 meses</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Garantia incondicional de 7 dias</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://alunos.fluentenomundo.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-editorial-secondary w-full text-center text-sm font-semibold !py-3.5"
        >
          Matricular no Mensal (R$ 39,90)
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Plano Anual (Melhor Custo-Benefício & Destaque) -->
      <div class="editorial-card p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border-2 border-blue-700 relative">
        
        <!-- Selo de Mais Popular -->
        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-700 text-white text-[11px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase shadow-md">
          Mais Escolhido · 2 Meses Grátis
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
              Formação Contínua
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-emerald-700 font-bold">Economize 20%</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900">
            Plano Anual Global
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 mb-6">
            O pacote definitivo para quem tem compromisso real com a fluência e quer garantir todas as formações.
          </p>

          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-2">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">12x de R$</span>
            <span class="text-5xl font-heading font-black text-slate-900">33</span>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-600">,25</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">/mês</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-slate-100">
            ou R$ 399,00 à vista no PIX com desconto (equivalente a R$ 33/mês).
          </p>

          <!-- Benefícios Inclusos -->
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-700 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              <span><strong>TUDO do Plano Mensal incluso</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Acesso a todas as <strong>Formações Complementares</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Acesso liberado à <strong>Jornada Poliglota</strong> (12 idiomas)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Biblioteca de Ebooks e Materiais Premium</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Acesso prioritário às novas masterclasses</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>4 Certificados trimestrais ao longo do ano</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Garantia incondicional blindada de 7 dias</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://alunos.fluentenomundo.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-editorial-primary w-full text-center text-sm font-semibold !py-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>Garantir Vaga no Anual com Desconto</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Dúvidas sobre Matrícula -->
    <div class="mt-10 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
      <span>Ficou com alguma dúvida sobre pagamentos ou emissão de nota fiscal?</span>
      <a href="/contato" class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-800 font-semibold ml-1 underline">
        Fale diretamente com nosso atendimento
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
